<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>ISFP’s Sunset (Fading Light)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">樊宇镈(Coulson Fan)</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">ISFP's Sunset</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">52kpFNcIkHZem0TLFWkQqv</ttm:item><itunes:duration>03:50.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500">演唱：樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.020" end="00:01.520">作词：樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.040" end="00:01.540">作曲：樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.400" end="00:01.900">You forgot your scarf</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.400" end="00:04.680">那天你围巾落在了椅背上</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.680" end="00:06.180">So I folded it the way you like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.680" end="00:09.030">我照你平时的方式折好</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.030" end="00:10.530">Left it by your door</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.030" end="00:11.590">放在你家门口</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.590" end="00:13.090">Didn’t text</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.590" end="00:13.090">没发消息</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.820" end="00:14.320">Just walked away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.820" end="00:17.280">也没打扰你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.280" end="00:18.780">You said you loved sunsets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.280" end="00:22.150">你说你喜欢傍晚的落日</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.150" end="00:23.650">So I changed my route</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.150" end="00:27.380">我换了一条回家的路</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.380" end="00:28.880">Just to walk with you once</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.380" end="00:30.160">从你可能出现的那条巷子走</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.160" end="00:31.660">But stayed a step behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.160" end="00:36.510">看到你了，但我走得比你慢一点</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.510" end="00:38.010">I never told you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.510" end="00:41.110">我从没说过我在</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.110" end="00:42.610">But I was always there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.110" end="00:45.690">但其实我一直都在</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.690" end="00:47.190">In the quiet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.690" end="00:47.250">在你以为没人陪的时候</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.250" end="00:48.750">In the small things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.250" end="00:48.850">在那些你没有注意的小细节里</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.850" end="00:50.350">You never asked about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.850" end="00:54.320">你好像从不问我的心思</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.320" end="00:55.820">I never needed words</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.320" end="00:56.750">但我不需要你说什么</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.750" end="00:58.250">I just hoped you'd notice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.750" end="00:59.160">只希望你能感觉到</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.160" end="01:00.660">The tea I made each night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.160" end="01:01.280">那些细微的照顾</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.280" end="01:02.780">The silence I left open</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.280" end="01:03.640">那些静静的守护</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.640" end="01:05.140">The way I stayed behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.640" end="01:05.930">在你难过的时候</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.930" end="01:07.430">When things got too broken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.930" end="01:08.290">我陪在你身旁</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.290" end="01:09.790">I’m not loud, not bright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.290" end="01:11.620">想去说些什么，但又怕打扰到你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.620" end="01:13.120">But I was always hoping</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.620" end="01:13.120">也许默默的陪伴就是最好</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.070" end="01:14.570">I never raised my voice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.070" end="01:15.360">在我们的争吵里，我从来没提高声音</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.360" end="01:16.860">But I was always listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.360" end="01:17.840">我压抑着情绪，尽可能去理解你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.840" end="01:19.340">The shoes I cleaned for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.840" end="01:19.960">为你做的每一件小事</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.960" end="01:21.460">The door I left half-open</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.960" end="01:22.190">体贴你的每一个瞬间</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.190" end="01:23.690">I held the pain so still</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.190" end="01:24.340">你说你怕束缚</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.340" end="01:25.840">So you could breathe so freely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.340" end="01:26.580">所以我连关门都留一条缝</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.580" end="01:28.080">I’m not loud, not brave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.580" end="01:29.920">一直把自己藏得很轻</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.920" end="01:31.420">But I was always steady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.920" end="01:32.380">因为我真的喜欢你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.380" end="01:33.880">You cried once at the train stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.380" end="01:36.220">那次你在地铁站哭了，说你好累</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.220" end="01:37.720">I didn’t ask why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.220" end="01:38.130">我知道了我们的结果，但没问你为什么</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.130" end="01:39.630">Just stood beside you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.130" end="01:40.990">只是站在你身旁</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.990" end="01:42.490">Offered a napkin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.990" end="01:43.590">递了一张纸巾</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.590" end="01:45.090">Then changed the song when we got home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.590" end="01:49.510">回到家，我把你最讨厌的那首歌换掉了</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.510" end="01:51.010">You said you hate goodbyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.510" end="01:54.640">你说你不喜欢道别</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.640" end="01:56.140">So I never made one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.640" end="01:59.350">所以我最后也没说再见</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.350" end="02:00.850">Just let you drift</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.350" end="02:02.160">只是慢慢走开</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.160" end="02:03.660">Even if it meant</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.160" end="02:03.660">怕你觉得有压力</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.660" end="02:05.160">You’d forget where I was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.660" end="02:09.490">也怕你真的不会回头</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.490" end="02:10.990">It’s okay if you missed it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.490" end="02:13.340">可能你从来没发现</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.340" end="02:14.840">I wasn’t trying to be known</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.340" end="02:18.050">我为你做的事都很小</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.050" end="02:19.550">Just wanted to love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.050" end="02:20.600">小到不被察觉</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.600" end="02:22.100">Without asking for return</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.600" end="02:26.000">但我不是想被看见，只是想你轻松一点就好</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.000" end="02:27.500">I never needed words</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.000" end="02:29.040">我不需要你说什么</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.040" end="02:30.540">I just hoped you'd notice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.040" end="02:31.080">只希望你能感觉到</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.080" end="02:32.580">The tea I made each night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.080" end="02:33.450">那些细微的照顾</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.450" end="02:34.950">The silence I left open</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.450" end="02:35.860">那些静静的守护</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.860" end="02:37.360">The way I stayed behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.860" end="02:38.100">在你难过的时候</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.100" end="02:39.600">When things got too broken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.100" end="02:40.320">我陪在你身旁</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.320" end="02:41.820">I’m not loud, not bright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.320" end="02:43.620">想去说些什么，但又怕打扰到你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.620" end="02:45.120">But I was always hoping</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.620" end="02:45.240">也许默默的陪伴就是最好</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.240" end="02:46.740">I never raised my voice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.240" end="02:47.480">在我们的争吵里，我从来没提高声音</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.480" end="02:48.980">But I was always listening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.480" end="02:49.770">我压抑着情绪，尽可能去理解你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.770" end="02:51.270">The shoes I cleaned for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.770" end="02:52.070">为你做的每一件小事</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.070" end="02:53.570">The door I left half-open</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.070" end="02:54.410">体贴你的每一个瞬间</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.410" end="02:55.910">I held the pain so still</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.410" end="02:56.650">你说你怕束缚</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.650" end="02:58.150">So you could breathe so freely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.650" end="02:58.830">所以我连关门都留一条缝</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.830" end="03:00.330">I’m not loud, not brave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.830" end="03:01.860">一直把自己藏得很轻</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.860" end="03:03.360">But I was always steady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.860" end="03:06.300">因为我真的喜欢你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.300" end="03:07.800">Some of us love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.300" end="03:08.210">有些人爱得像风</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.210" end="03:09.710">Like leaves in a window</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.210" end="03:11.940">轻轻地吹过你窗前</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.940" end="03:13.440">Quiet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.940" end="03:13.910">不吵</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.910" end="03:15.410">Brief</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.910" end="03:16.470">不闹</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.470" end="03:17.970">But always</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.470" end="03:18.630">却一直</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.630" end="03:20.130">Trying to catch your light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.630" end="03:24.300">在找一个角度，落在你需要的地方</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.300" end="03:25.800">I never asked you to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.300" end="03:27.040">我从没开口让你留下</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.040" end="03:28.540">But I always made it easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.040" end="03:29.130">我一直在为你让路</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.130" end="03:30.630">I showed up in small ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.130" end="03:31.250">你总是走得很快</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.250" end="03:32.750">When you thought no one could see me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.250" end="03:33.820">我就悄悄换路</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.820" end="03:35.320">I held back every time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.820" end="03:35.980">在你习惯的时间经过你身边</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.980" end="03:37.480">So you'd never feel too heavy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.980" end="03:38.290">也许多年后的某个黄昏你会想起我</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:38.290" end="03:39.790">I gave without a name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:38.290" end="03:40.700">会发现那些无微不至的细节里</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:40.700" end="03:42.200">And loved you almost quietly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:40.700" end="03:44.700">其实藏着我对你最深的爱意</p></div></body></tt>